@startuml UC-P1-create-a-project-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-P1 Create a project (analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person and Playground as one box. No outside system takes part.
' Alpha scope (decision 13): only an administrator creates a project, and there are no project roles.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie.
' Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-P1.
' Not drawn: the order of the refusals, and whether a refused creation is audited (open questions 1 and 2).

actor "Administrator" as U
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB

U -> PG : 1 create a project\n(name, first members)
alt not an administrator
  PG --> U : 2 refused
else name empty or over 100
  PG --> U : 3 refused
else a first member is not\nactive or unknown
  PG --> U : 4 refused
else
  PG -> PG : 5 create it,\nthe named people are members
  PG -> PG : 6 record who and\nwho the first members are
  PG --> U : 7 the new project
end
@enduml
